   "scope": "All 21 same-input archives use the exact bare toPptx caller without registered catalogs. Every old hash/size/part count reproduced. Only default theme root/family and app theme-name metadata changes, plus three table OPF_DATA_V1.environment digests recomputed by unchanged theme/table-style hashing. All other decoded tag fields, native payloads, diagnostics, inventories and the three native-slide digests remain identical. All prior history remains unchanged; source-candidate output is not a registry or native UI acceptance claim."
  }
